					"uidString": "Ahog3iAPTvWHq3lBfwnesg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "CRRuntimeRegistry is the entry point for runtime lifecycle. CRRuntime represents the fabric. CRDeploymentTopology is the mutable observed world model. CRDeploymentSnapshot is the read-only deterministic view used for routing, planning, and statistics."
			},
